<html>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #111; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
      <h1 style="color: #1370c6; margin: 0;">Omnicassion</h1>
    </div>

    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Claim Your Business</h2>

    <p>Hello,</p>

    <p>You're one step away from claiming <strong>{{businessName}}</strong> on Omnicassion.</p>

    <p>Use the verification code below to complete your claim:</p>

    <div style="background: #f4f4f5; border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px; text-align: center; margin: 24px 0;">
      <span style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 8px; color: #1370c6;">{{verificationCode}}</span>
    </div>

    <p style="color: #666; font-size: 14px;">This code will expire in <strong>{{expiresIn}}</strong>.</p>

    <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e7; margin: 24px 0;" />

    <p style="color: #666; font-size: 14px;">
      By claiming this business, you'll be able to:
    </p>
    <ul style="color: #666; font-size: 14px; padding-left: 20px;">
      <li>Manage your business profile</li>
      <li>Respond to customer inquiries</li>
      <li>Showcase your portfolio</li>
      <li>Receive booking requests</li>
    </ul>

    <p style="color: #666; font-size: 14px;">
      If you didn't request to claim this business, please ignore this email.
    </p>

    <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e7; margin: 24px 0;" />

    <p style="color: #999; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;">
      &copy; {{currentYear}} Omnicassion. All rights reserved.
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
